# Lykodex workflow

Read `HANDOFF.md` before starting work. It is the shared source of truth with Claude Code (no live link between agents).

- **`main` is the only stream.** Do not recreate old V0 branches.
- **V0** designs one screen or component at a time against `DESIGN_TOKENS.md`. Never import or boot this repo in v0 — its preview parses our Tailwind CSS as JavaScript (`SyntaxError: Unexpected token '*'`).
- **Cursor** wires V0 output into the real Vite app.
- **Claude Code** handles troubleshooting, verification, and some backend/native work, per task.

Before committing: `git diff` any file you did not fully author this session, then `npx oxlint <files>` and `npm run build` (both clean). Live-check visual changes. Match on-disk import casing for Linux CI.
